    {
        "content": "<p>fitzgen <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14116#issuecomment-5360925424\">commented</a> on <a href=\"https://github.com/bytecodealliance/wasmtime/pull/14116\">PR #14116</a>:</p>\n<blockquote>\n<p>@alexcrichton mind taking another look? when rebasing this, it went across the vmctx macro stuff, so I added another commit that makes it avoid defining new <code>AliasRegions</code> helpers in <code>crates/cranelift</code> and instead use macro-generated helpers, but this required some minor surgery to the macro to support accessing fields that are dynamic based on the target pointer size, but not the full <code>VMOffsets</code>.</p>\n</blockquote>",
